# The apps catalogue is canonical on its own subdomain. The hop from
# vijaykrsha.online/apps to apps.vijaykrsha.online/apps is host-aware and
# therefore lives in the /apps Function route (functions/apps.ts): rules in
# this file cannot match on hostname, so a rule here would also fire on the
# apps host and redirect the page to itself.
#
# The SPA catch-all below must stay last.
# Cloudflare Pages applies the first matching rule, so every other route is
# handed to the client-side router.
/* /index.html 200
